# These are committed, fully-synthetic local-collector source-home fixtures.
# Repo-root ignores (e.g. *.log, .codex/) would otherwise swallow realistic
# fixture filenames like debug.log; un-ignore the whole source-home trees so
# the fixtures stay committable and survive a clean checkout / CI.
!claude_code/source-home/**
!codex/source-home/**

# Raw captures hold UNSCRUBBED provider data — real names, emails, message
# bodies. PDPP_CAPTURE_FIXTURES=1 writes them here during a real run, and a
# DOM-capture connector leaks names by default (a bare name in an HTML text
# node matches no structured field, so the deterministic scrubber cannot see
# it). Only the SCRUBBED output is committable. Ignore raw at every depth so a
# capture can never reach a commit by accident, and so this survives a clean
# checkout rather than depending on .git/info/exclude, which is per-clone and
# silently absent in a fresh worktree.
**/raw/
fixture_capture*/
